+    · simp only [hj, false_and, if_false]
+  · funext j
+    simp only [Cfg.mapState_workTapePos, seekPost_workTapePos, zr_rulerCopyContract,
+      copyMapTM_contract_post, sweepPost_workTapePos, zr_rightWord, zoneCells_length,
